    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i was thinking of making big salads with like 3-4 cups of spinach every morning and lunch to really get the benefits. i'm currently taking warfarin for my heart so i want to make sure i'm doing everything possible to keep my cardiovascular system strong. is it okay to just ramp up the greens like that?",
